Hi Hairdoo.
It seems to me from the last sentence that you haven't
actually reached the castle level.  The castle level does
have a moat around it, but it's only one layer thick.  If
the screen you see is about half filled with water, then
I'd say you hit "medusa's level", and not the castle.

In this is the case, I would give the following advice:

1.  You're an 18 level valk.  Back off and do the quest first.
You will get an item that you can #invoke can solve this
problem.

-----> If you don't heed this advice, and want to proceed....

2.  If you cross the water now using your potion, there's
a chance of finding a set of boots that should help you
get back inside a statue inside the keep (too small to
be called castle).

3.  Beware!!  This is called "Medusa's Level".  Take
approprate precautions.

4.  Another way to get across the water is to dig down
in the room you're in right now.  You can then climb
back upstairs and use the potion to get back.
WARNING:  read advice #3 before climbing back up the
stairs.

5.  If you do dig down, you will eventually reach the "real"
castle level, and as suggested by the people before me,
there is a wand of wishing there.

